# QA (M2, D-045): a relaxed full run of Stage 3 at walking pace (handwritten,
# no solver prefix). Uferweg: bumps the M-box, waits for the Mozartkugel
# (PowerUp), over the rock wall, waits on the boulder until E-Biker #1 crashes
# into it, stomps walker #1. Kornmuehle: over the mill race, onto the hive and
# under swarm #1, climbs the mill and takes bonus 1 on the ridge, stomps the
# tourist below, bumps the ?-box from below as Zuckerschock. Bienenhaus: stops
# left of swarm #2's reach, waits ~3 s, walks under it to the free column 102,
# hops on the 1-high hive, onto the stack behind walker #2 and stomps it, up
# onto the right bee-house roof (6 Oblaten) and drops off past swarm #3.
# Fuenf Haeuser: checkpoint, stomps the charging E-Biker #2, climbs house 2
# behind walker #3 and stomps it, stomps the garden tourist, over house 3,
# through the garden while swarm #4 dances up-right, onto house 4, bumps the
# Zaunerstollen box (ExtraLife; E-Biker #3 crashes into house 4 below: no
# harm), over the chimney, stomps walker #4 on house 5. Badesteg: walking
# jumps, waits for swarm #5 to rise, under it and over the 3-gap, climbs the
# boathouse and walks off its roof to the pole (100). Never hurt.
# Maibaum touch at frame 3839 = 64 s (D-045: 3 x 64 = 192 -> 200 s).
